        "@value": "Two of Canada’s premiere soloists – flautist <strong>Leslie Newman</strong> (also the BSO’s Principal Flute) and harpist <strong>Erica Goodman</strong>, together perform one of Mozart’s most popular Concertos, in the marvellous sanctuary at St. Andrew’s United Church. Two other works by Mozart, a Cassation, and Symphony #29, will fill out the program, making it a delightful Amadeus evening."
